#: includes/class-ypm-ai-translation.php:1692
msgid ""
"AI returned a response outside the required translation JSON contract. "
"WordPress content remains unchanged; retry the translation."
msgstr ""
"AI a renvoyé une réponse hors du contrat JSON de traduction requis. Le "
"contenu WordPress reste inchangé ; relancez la traduction."

#: includes/class-ypm-ai-translation.php:1326
msgid ""
"AI returned an empty excerpt for a source item that has one. Run the draft "
"again or choose another text model."
msgstr ""
"AI a renvoyé un extrait vide pour un élément source qui en possède un. "
"Relancez le brouillon ou choisissez un autre modèle texte."

#: includes/class-ypm-ai-translation.php:1104
msgid ""
"AI returned an empty localized term name. Run the draft again or choose "
"another text model."
msgstr ""
"AI a renvoyé un nom de terme localisé vide. Relancez le brouillon ou "
"choisissez un autre modèle texte."

#: includes/class-ypm-ai-translation.php:1137
msgid ""
"AI returned an empty string translation. Run the suggestion again or choose"
" another text model."
msgstr ""
"AI a renvoyé une traduction de chaîne vide. Relancez la suggestion ou "
"choisissez un autre modèle texte."

#: includes/class-ypm-ai-translation.php:1106
msgid ""
"AI returned an empty term description for a source term that has one. Run "
"the draft again or choose another text model."
msgstr ""
"AI a renvoyé une description de terme vide pour un terme source qui en "
"possède une. Relancez le brouillon ou choisissez un autre modèle texte."

#: includes/class-ypm-ai-translation.php:1325
msgid ""
"AI returned an empty title. Run the draft again or choose another text "
"model."
msgstr ""
"AI a renvoyé un titre vide. Relancez le brouillon ou choisissez un autre "
"modèle texte."

#: includes/class-ypm-ai-content-segments.php:175
msgid ""
"AI returned an empty translation for a required page segment. Source "
"content remains unchanged; run the draft again or choose another text "
"model."
msgstr ""
"AI a renvoyé une traduction vide pour un segment de page requis. Le contenu"
" source reste inchangé ; relancez le brouillon ou choisissez un autre "
"modèle texte."

#: includes/class-ypm-ai-content-segments.php:166
#: includes/class-ypm-ai-translation.php:1280
msgid ""
"AI returned an incomplete structured localization set. WordPress content "
"remains unchanged; retry the staged translation."
msgstr ""
"AI a renvoyé un ensemble de localisation structurée incomplet. Le contenu "
"WordPress reste inchangé ; relancez la traduction par étapes."

#: includes/class-ypm-ai-translation.php:1277
msgid ""
"AI returned an invalid structured segment value. Source content remains "
"unchanged; run the draft again or choose another text model."
msgstr ""
"AI a renvoyé une valeur de segment structuré invalide. Le contenu source "
"reste inchangé ; relancez le brouillon ou choisissez un autre modèle texte."

#: includes/class-ypm-ai-translation.php:2268
msgid "AI returned an unknown protected token. The suggestion was rejected."
msgstr "AI a renvoyé un jeton protégé inconnu. La suggestion a été rejetée."

#: includes/class-ypm-ai-content-segments.php:163
msgid ""
"AI returned an unknown structured localization segment. Source content "
"remains unchanged; verify the selected model and run the draft again."
msgstr ""
"AI a renvoyé un segment de localisation structurée inconnu. Le contenu "
"source reste inchangé ; vérifiez le modèle sélectionné et relancez le "
"brouillon."

#: includes/class-ypm-ai-translation.php:1276
msgid ""
"AI returned an unknown structured segment ID. Source content remains "
